    "title": "Multi-Series Line Chart",
    "category": "Trend",
    "description": "A multi-series line chart plots several lines on the same axes, each a different colour and one per series, so you can compare how multiple things trend together over the same axis. You read not just each line's own shape but how the lines diverge, converge, or cross. A legend ties each colour to its series.",
    "whenToUse": "When you want to compare the trends of several series over the same ordered axis and see where they cross or pull apart.",
